<header class="mcap-hero" id="overview"><div class="container"><nav class="mcap-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>About REALJET</span><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">Manufacturing capabilities</span></nav><div class="mcap-hero-grid"><div class="mcap-hero-copy"><span class="mcap-eyebrow">The company behind your components</span><h1>Inside REALJET’s<br /> manufacturing capability.</h1><p>Established in Changsha in 2008, REALJET connects metal fabrication, machining and mechanical assembly around the equipment drawing.</p><a class="button" href="#manufacturing">Explore our processes <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><div class="mcap-location"><span>Changsha, Hunan, China</span><span>Established 2008</span></div><a class="mcap-hero-certificates" href="#credentials">Management system certificates: ISO 9001 · ISO 14001 · ISO 45001 ↗</a></div><div class="mcap-hero-visual"><figure class="mcap-factory"><img src="/images/manufacturing-split/realjet-factory.webp" width="800" height="533" alt="REALJET factory and company building in Changsha" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption>REALJET / Changsha</figcaption></figure><figure class="mcap-workshop-inset"><img src="/images/manufacturing-split/real-assets/machining-centres.jpg" width="869" height="580" alt="CNC machining centres pictured in REALJET’s company profile" /><figcaption>CNC machining centres</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></header>

<section class="mcap-section" id="manufacturing"><div class="container"><div class="mcap-heading"><div><span class="mcap-eyebrow">Manufacturing processes</span><h2>Fabrication, machining<br /> and finishing.</h2></div><p>Cut and formed parts become welded structures. Machining establishes the interfaces. Finishing and fit checks complete the agreed supply condition.</p></div><div class="mcap-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Manufacturing processes">{% for process in manufacturingCapabilities.processes %}<button type="button" role="tab" id="mcap-tab-{{ process.id }}" aria-controls="mcap-panel-{{ process.id }}" aria-selected="{% if loop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" tabindex="{% if loop.first %}0{% else %}-1{% endif %}" data-capability-tab="{{ process.id }}">{{ process.label }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>{% endfor %}</div>
{% for process in manufacturingCapabilities.processes %}<div class="mcap-process-panel" id="mcap-panel-{{ process.id }}" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="mcap-tab-{{ process.id }}"{% if not loop.first %} hidden{% endif %}><div class="mcap-process-photos">{% for photo in process.images %}<figure{% if loop.first %} class="mcap-process-primary"{% endif %}><img src="{{ photo.src }}" alt="{{ photo.alt }}" width="1050" height="580" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />{% if photo.caption %}<figcaption>{{ photo.caption }}</figcaption>{% endif %}</figure>{% endfor %}</div><div class="mcap-process-copy"><span class="mcap-eyebrow">{{ process.label }}</span><h3>{{ process.title }}</h3><p>{{ process.intro }}</p><dl>{% for feature in process.features %}<div><dt>{{ feature[0] }}</dt><dd>{{ feature[1] }}</dd></div>{% endfor %}</dl><div class="mcap-equipment-note"><span>Equipment &amp; resources</span><p>{{ process.equipment }}</p></div><div class="mcap-supply-note">{{ process.supply }}</div></div></div>{% endfor %}
<div class="mcap-review-strip"><strong>Start with the features that control the fit.</strong><p>Share the material, drawing datums and critical dimensions so the machine envelope, clamping and inspection route can be reviewed for your part.</p><button type="button" data-universal-enquiry data-enquiry-keyword="Manufacturing process and critical feature review">Enquiry ↗</button></div></div></section>

{% include "components/manufacturing-credentials.njk" %}

<section class="mcap-section mcap-industries" id="industries"><div class="container mcap-industries-layout"><div class="mcap-industries-intro"><span class="mcap-eyebrow">Applications</span><h2>Manufacturing around<br /> your equipment.</h2><p>The interface requirements change from one machine to another. Define what the part locates, supports and connects.</p><figure><img src="/images/manufacturing-split/real-assets/machined-structure.jpg" width="869" height="580" alt="Structural component set up for machining in the REALJET company profile" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>From fabrication to machined interfaces</figcaption></figure></div><div class="mcap-industry-list">{% for industry in manufacturingCapabilities.industries %}<article><span class="mcap-industry-index">0{{ loop.index }}</span><div><h3>{{ industry.title }}</h3><span class="mcap-industry-parts">{{ industry.parts }}</span><p>{{ industry.text }}</p>{% if industry.url %}<a href="{{ industry.url }}">{{ industry.link }} ↗</a>{% else %}<button type="button" data-universal-enquiry data-enquiry-keyword="{{ industry.enquiry }}">Discuss your component ↗</button>{% endif %}</div></article>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>

<section class="mcap-section mcap-materials" id="materials"><div class="container"><div class="mcap-heading"><div><span class="mcap-eyebrow">Materials</span><h2>The material specification<br /> comes first.</h2></div><p>Steel structures are a core part of our fabrication work. For aluminum alloy, stainless steel and alloy steel, the grade and supply condition set the route for forming, joining, machining and finishing.</p></div><div class="mcap-material-grid">{% for material in manufacturingCapabilities.materials %}<article><span class="mcap-material-tag">{{ material.tag }}</span><h3>{{ material.name }}</h3><p>{{ material.text }}</p><div class="mcap-material-review"><span>Include with your drawing</span><p>{{ material.review }}</p></div></article>{% endfor %}</div><div class="mcap-material-photo"><img src="/images/manufacturing-split/real-assets/laser-cutting.jpg" width="1050" height="580" alt="Plate cutting equipment photographed in the company profile" loading="lazy" /><div><span class="mcap-eyebrow">Plan before cutting</span><strong>Grade. Condition. Geometry. Finish.</strong><p>Include the material specification and delivery condition with the drawing, so the manufacturing review starts from the same requirement.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="mcap-section mcap-quality" id="quality"><div class="container"><div class="mcap-heading"><div><span class="mcap-eyebrow">Quality control</span><h2>Inspect against<br /> the accepted drawing.</h2></div><p>Link the drawing revision, material, process stages and final condition in an agreed inspection plan. Decide the records required before manufacturing starts.</p></div><div class="mcap-quality-grid">{% for check in manufacturingCapabilities.checks %}<article><span>0{{ loop.index }}</span><h3>{{ check[0] }}</h3><p>{{ check[1] }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div><div class="mcap-quality-resources"><div><span class="mcap-eyebrow">Inspection resources</span><h3>Match the method to the feature.</h3><p>Available resources include PMT ALPHAm articulated measuring equipment, hardness testing and dimensional gauges. Select the instrument, support condition and measuring range against the agreed check, with suitable calibration status and measurement uncertainty.</p></div><div class="mcap-records"><h3>Records to agree with the order</h3><ul><li>Material certificates and traceability</li><li>First-article and dimensional results</li><li>Specified weld or coating checks</li><li>Trial-fit and release records</li></ul><p>Confirm the required documents and acceptance criteria in the quotation scope.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="mcap-section mcap-close"><div class="container"><div class="mcap-close-panel"><div><span class="mcap-eyebrow">Your next component</span><h2>Put the capability<br /> to work on your drawing.</h2><p>Explore our manufacturing services and component collection, or share the features that matter for a manufacturing review.</p></div><div class="mcap-close-actions"><a class="button" href="/solutions/contract-manufacturing/">View manufacturing services ↗</a><button type="button" data-universal-enquiry data-enquiry-keyword="Manufacturing capability and inspection review">Enquiry ↗</button></div></div></div></section>
